@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontColor white
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant ":MainWindow" as UI UI_COLOR
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant "mark:MarkCommand" as Mark LOGIC_COLOR
participant "candidate:ModelManager" as Candidate MODEL_COLOR
participant ":StorageManager" as Storage STORAGE_COLOR
participant "live:ModelManager" as Live MODEL_COLOR

UI -> Logic : execute("mark 1 m/CS2103T w/1 s/present")
activate UI
activate Logic
note over Logic, Mark
Parsing, command creation and getTarget(live) omitted.
Assume valid input, displayed index and enrolment.
end note
note over Logic
Replacement flow below runs inside
executeStudentReplacement(mark, target).
end note
create Candidate
Logic -> Candidate : new ModelManager(...)
activate Candidate
Candidate --> Logic
deactivate Candidate
Logic -> Candidate : updateFilteredPersonList(displayed::contains)
activate Candidate
Candidate --> Logic
deactivate Candidate
Logic -> Mark : execute(candidate)
activate Mark
note over Mark, Candidate
Resolve the target; validate enrolment.
Read the current course/week status.
withAttendance(decision) creates an immutable copy
for a changed decision, or removes it for Unrecorded.
Detailed Person calls are omitted.
end note
opt status differs
Mark -> Candidate : setPerson(target, updated)
activate Candidate
Candidate --> Mark
deactivate Candidate
end
Mark --> Logic : result (selected student)
deactivate Mark

alt selected student equals original target
Logic --> UI : result (Attendance unchanged)
note over UI, Logic
Select target; retain class/week context.
No disk write or live replacement.
end note
else selected student differs
alt save succeeds
Logic -> Storage : saveAddressBook(candidate.getAddressBook())
activate Storage
Storage --> Logic : return
deactivate Storage
Logic -> Live : setPerson(target, updated)
activate Live
Live --> Logic
deactivate Live
Logic --> UI : result (Attendance set)
note over UI
Select updated student; refresh details.
Retain class/week context and row order.
end note
else save fails
Logic -> Storage : saveAddressBook(candidate.getAddressBook())
activate Storage
Storage --> Logic : IOException
deactivate Storage
note over Logic
Log failure; wrap in CommandException.
end note
Logic --> UI : CommandException
note over UI, Live
Show error; retain input, selection, badges and data.
No live.setPerson call and no success result on this path.
end note
end
end

deactivate Logic
deactivate UI
@enduml
